.TH JAGS 1
.SH NAME
jags \- Just Another Gnome Samba Client
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBjags\fP [\-c \fIserver\fR] [\-\-nowindows] [\-h]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBjags\fP is Just Another Gtk+ Samba-client. It is a GUI frontend running over Samba and Smbmount using the GTK+ or Gtkmm and Gnomemm toolkits. It's easy to use and very configurable.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c \fIserver\fR
Server to search for
.TP
\fB\-\-nowindows\fR
Just mount shares in config-file. Do not show Jags main-window.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
List of options
.SH AUTHOR 
\fBjags\fR was written by Daniel Sundberg <dss@homs.se>. This manual page \fBjags\fR(1) was written for the Debian project by Remco van de Meent <remco@debian.org>.

